dsh-ssh-files-sidebar

This project integrates with and depends on the following open-source projects:

1. @linxin666/dsh-ssh
   Source: https://github.com/DamonKoy/dsh-web-ui/tree/main/packages/dsh-ssh
   License: Apache License 2.0
   Provides the SSH host store, SSH/SFTP engine, web terminal, transfer/tunnel UI,
   HTTP/WebSocket routes, and agent SSH tools.

2. dsh-rw
   Source: https://github.com/MDR-EX1000/dsh-rw
   License: MIT
   Provides the remote-workspace placeholder model, workspace routes, rw_* tools,
   and native-tool remote shim used by this integrated plugin.

The dependency projects retain their respective copyrights and license terms.
